#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Permission Method"
msgstr "Uburyo bw'uburenganzira ku bishushanyo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are four methods for determining a User's Graph Permissions.  The first is 'Permissive'.  Under the 'Permissive' setting, a User only needs access to either the Graph, Device or Graph Template to gain access to the Graphs that apply to them.  Under 'Restrictive', the User must have access to the Graph, the Device, and the Graph Template to gain access to the Graph.  These first two methods have scalability problems for very large installs.  So, two additional options are available.  They are 'Device Based', which means if you have access to the Device, you get access to it's Graphs.  And lastly 'Graph Template Based', which means if you have access to the 'Graph Template' you get access to all Device Graphs of that Template."
msgstr "Hari uburyo bune bwo kugena uburenganzira bw'ukoresha ku bishushanyo. Ubwa mbere ni 'Bwisanzuye'. Mu igenamiterere rya 'Bwisanzuye', ukoresha akenera gusa uburenganzira ku gishushanyo, ku gikoresho cyangwa ku nyandikorugero y'igishushanyo kugira ngo agere ku bishushanyo bimureba. Mu buryo bwa 'Bukumira', ukoresha agomba kuba afite uburenganzira ku gishushanyo, ku gikoresho, no ku nyandikorugero y'igishushanyo kugira ngo agere ku gishushanyo. Ubu buryo bubiri bwa mbere bugira ibibazo byo kwaguka ku mashyirwamo manini cyane. Ku bw'ibyo, hari ubundi buryo bubiri bw'inyongera. Ubwo ni 'Bushingiye ku gikoresho', bisobanura ko niba ufite uburenganzira ku gikoresho, ubona n'uburenganzira ku bishushanyo byacyo. Hanyuma ubwa nyuma ni 'Bushingiye ku nyandikorugero y'igishushanyo', bisobanura ko niba ufite uburenganzira ku 'Nyandikorugero y'igishushanyo' ubona uburenganzira ku bishushanyo byose by'ibikoresho by'iyo nyandikorugero."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Permissive"
msgstr "Bwisanzuye"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Restrictive"
msgstr "Bukumira"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Device Based"
msgstr "Bushingiye ku gikoresho"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph/Data Source Creation Method"
msgstr "Uburyo bwo kurema igishushanyo/isoko y'amakuru"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If set to Simple, Graphs and Data Sources can only be created from New Graphs.  If Advanced, legacy Graph and Data Source creation is supported."
msgstr "Niba bishyizwe kuri Byoroshye, ibishushanyo n'amasoko y'amakuru bishobora kuremwa gusa binyuze muri Ibishushanyo bishya. Niba ari Byisumbuye, kurema ibishushanyo n'amasoko y'amakuru mu buryo bwa kera biremewe."

