#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Cacti will set Radio Button to Delete related Data Sources of a Graph when removing Graphs.  Note: Cacti will not allow the removal of Data Sources if they are used in other Graphs."
msgstr "Iyo bikoreshejwe, Cacti izashyira akabuto k'ihitamo kuri Siba amasoko y'amakuru ajyanye n'igishushanyo mu gihe cyo gukuraho ibishushanyo. Icyitonderwa: Cacti ntizemerera gukurwaho kw'amasoko y'amakuru niba akoreshwa mu bindi bishushanyo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graphs Auto Unlock"
msgstr "Gufungura ibishushanyo mu buryo bwikora"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Cacti will not lock Graphs.  This allow a faster manual modification of Data Sources related to a Graph."
msgstr "Iyo bikoreshejwe, Cacti ntizafunga ibishushanyo. Ibi byoroshya guhindura vuba n'intoki amasoko y'amakuru ajyanye n'igishushanyo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Hide Cacti Dashboard"
msgstr "Hisha ikibaho nyobozi cya Cacti"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "For use with Cacti's External Link Support.  Using this setting, you can hide the Cacti Dashboard, so you can display just your own page."
msgstr "Bikoreshwa hamwe n'ubufasha bw'imiyoboro yo hanze bwa Cacti. Ukoresheje iri genamiterere, ushobora guhisha ikibaho nyobozi cya Cacti, kugira ngo werekane ipaji yawe bwite gusa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Drag-N-Drop"
msgstr "Koresha ugukurura no gushyira"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Some of Cacti's interfaces support Drag-N-Drop.  If checked this option will be enabled.  Note: For visually impaired user, this option may be disabled."
msgstr "Zimwe mu mbuga za Cacti zishyigikira ugukurura no gushyira. Niba bihiswemo, ubu buryo buzakoreshwa. Icyitonderwa: Ku bakoresha bafite ubumuga bwo kutabona, ubu buryo bushobora guhagarikwa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "GitHub/GitLab API Settings"
msgstr "Igenamiterere rya API ya GitHub/GitLab"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Base API Repository URL"
msgstr "URL fatizo y'ububiko bwa API"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you wish to get the latest plguins versions directly from GitHub or GitLab enter the GitHub or GitLab API url here.  The default is https://api.github.com/.  Change this only if you have your own repository that you maintain for Cacti Plugins."
msgstr "Niba wifuza kubona verisiyo nshya z'imigereka mu buryo butaziguye kuri GitHub cyangwa GitLab, andika hano URL ya API ya GitHub cyangwa GitLab. Ibisanzwe ni https://api.github.com/. Hindura ibi gusa niba ufite ububiko bwawe bwite ucunga ku bw'imigereka ya Cacti."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "GitHub User Account"
msgstr "Konti y'ukoresha ya GitHub"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The User account that holds your GitHub/GitLab repositories.  Change this only if you have your own repository that you maintain for Cacti Plugins."
msgstr "Konti y'ukoresha ibitse ububiko bwawe bwa GitHub/GitLab. Hindura ibi gusa niba ufite ububiko bwawe bwite ucunga ku bw'imigereka ya Cacti."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Personal Access Token"
msgstr "Ikimenyetso bwite cyo kwinjira"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you wish to get the latest plguins versions directly from GitHub without overly restricted rate limiting, enter your Personal Access Token here."
msgstr "Niba wifuza kubona verisiyo nshya z'imigereka mu buryo butaziguye kuri GitHub utabangamiwe cyane n'umubare ntarengwa w'ibisabwa, andika hano ikimenyetso cyawe bwite cyo kwinjira."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Unsafe Plugin Installs"
msgstr "Emera iyinjiza ry'imigereka itizewe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If you would like to allow the installation of Cacti Plugins from their 'develop' branch, check this checkbox."
msgstr "Niba wifuza kwemerera iyinjiza ry'imigereka ya Cacti ikuwe ku ishami ryayo rya 'develop', shyira akamenyetso muri aka gasanduku."

#: include/global_settings.php
