msgstr "Izina ry'umwanditsi wifuza ko ritangazwa hamwe n'inyandikorugero y'igikoresho cyangwa ipaki."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Author Email Address"
msgstr "Aderesi ya imeyili y'umwanditsi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email address of the author that you wish published with the Device Template or Package."
msgstr "Aderesi ya imeyili y'umwanditsi wifuza ko itangazwa hamwe n'inyandikorugero y'igikoresho cyangwa ipaki."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Template/Package Copyright"
msgstr "Uburenganzira bw'umwanditsi ku nyandikorugero/ipaki"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default copyright that you would like to use for your packaged Device Templates and Packages."
msgstr "Uburenganzira bw'umwanditsi bw'ibanze wifuza gukoresha ku nyandikorugero z'ibikoresho zashyizwe mu mapaki n'amapaki yawe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Package/Template Import Defaults"
msgstr "Iby'ibanze mu kwinjiza ipaki/inyandikorugero"

#: include/global_settings.php package_import.php
msgid "Package Location"
msgstr "Aho ipaki iherereye"

#: include/global_settings.php package_import.php
msgid "Select the Location of the Packages that you wish to Import."
msgstr "Hitamo aho amapaki wifuza kwinjiza aherereye."

#: include/global_settings.php package_import.php
msgid "Replace Suggested Value Patterns"
msgstr "Simbuza imiterere y'agaciro katanzweho igitekerezo"

#: include/global_settings.php package_import.php
msgid "Replace Data Source and Graph Template Suggested Value Records.  Graphs and Data Sources will take on new names after either a Data Query Reindex or by using the forced Replace Suggested Values process."
msgstr "Simbuza ibyanditswe by'agaciro katanzweho igitekerezo by'isoko y'amakuru n'inyandikorugero y'igishushanyo. Ibishushanyo n'amasoko y'amakuru bizafata amazina mashya nyuma yo kongera gukora urutonde rw'ishakisha ry'amakuru cyangwa hakoreshejwe uburyo buhatiwe bwo Gusimbuza agaciro katanzweho igitekerezo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Site Security"
msgstr "Umutekano w'urubuga"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Force Connections over HTTPS"
msgstr "Hatira ihuza gukoresha HTTPS"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When checked, any attempts to access Cacti will be redirected to HTTPS to ensure high security."
msgstr "Iyo bihiswemo, ibigeragezo byose byo kugera kuri Cacti bizoherezwa kuri HTTPS kugira ngo habeho umutekano uhambaye."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Inline JavaScript Protection"
msgstr "Uburinzi bwa JavaScript yo mu ipaji"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls how the Content-Security-Policy restricts inline JavaScript.  HTMX keeps the 'unsafe-inline' policy that all current themes and plugins rely on and matches the behaviour of prior releases.  Nonce Migration emits a strict nonce policy in report-only mode so incompatible core and plugin scripts can be identified without breaking the UI.  Nonce Enforcement blocks scripts without the request nonce and requires CACTI_CSP_NONCE_ENFORCE to be true in include/config.php; without that explicit gate it safely remains in report-only mode.  None also permits unsafe eval() calls and is the least restrictive option."
msgstr "Igenzura uburyo Content-Security-Policy ibuzanya JavaScript yo mu murongo. HTMX igumana politiki ya 'unsafe-inline' insanganyamatsiko n'imigereka byose by'ubu bishingiraho kandi ihura n'imikorere y'amavugurura yabanje. Kwimukira kuri Nonce bitanga politiki ikaze ya nonce mu buryo bwa raporo gusa kugira ngo inyandikomvugo z'ibanze n'iz'imigereka zidahuza zishobore kumenyekana bidahungabanyije imigaragarire. Iyubahirizwa rya Nonce rikumira inyandikomvugo zitagira nonce y'isaba kandi bisaba ko CACTI_CSP_NONCE_ENFORCE iba true muri include/config.php; hatari iyo nzira yeruye biguma mu buryo bwa raporo gusa mu mutekano. Ntacyo kandi yemerera ihamagara rya eval() ridatekanye kandi ni yo mahitamo afite imipaka mike kurusha ayandi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "HTMX (Default)"
msgstr "HTMX (Mburabuzi)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Nonce Migration (Report Only)"
msgstr "Kwimukira kuri Nonce (Raporo Gusa)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Nonce Enforcement (Advanced)"
msgstr "Iyubahirizwa rya Nonce (Byisumbuye)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "CSP Violation Report URI"
msgstr "URI ya Raporo y'Irenga rya CSP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Used in Nonce Migration and Nonce Enforcement modes.  URL where browsers post Content-Security-Policy violation reports.  Leave blank to use the bundled csp_report.php handler under the configured Cacti URL path."
msgstr "Ikoreshwa mu buryo bwa Kwimukira kuri Nonce no mu buryo bw'Iyubahirizwa rya Nonce. URL aho mushakisha zohereza raporo z'irenga rya Content-Security-Policy. Siga ubusa kugira ngo ukoreshe mugenzuzi wa csp_report.php uri hamwe na yo munsi y'inzira ya URL ya Cacti yashyizweho."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Content-Security Alternate Sources"
msgstr "Inkomoko Zindi za Content-Security"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Space-delimited domain names that will be permitted to be accessed outside of the Web Server itself.  This is important for users choosing to use a CDN, or hosting site.  Sources can include wildcards for example: *.mydomain.com, or a protocol, for example: https://*.example.com.  These Alternate Sources include Image, CSS and JavaScript types only."
msgstr "Amazina y'imiyoboro atandukanyijwe n'umwanya azemererwa kugerwaho hanze ya Seriveri ya Urubuga ubwayo. Ibi ni ingenzi ku bakoresha bahisemo gukoresha CDN, cyangwa urubuga rwakira amakuru. Inkomoko zishobora kuba zirimo utumenyetso dushushanya inyuguti, urugero: *.mydomain.com, cyangwa porotokole, urugero: https://*.example.com. Izi Nkomoko Zindi zirimo ubwoko bw'Ishusho, CSS na JavaScript gusa."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable htmx for in-place filter updates"
msgstr "Emeza htmx ku ivugurura ry'imiyunguruzo mu mwanya umwe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, the htmx loader is included so pages that opt in can refresh their filter results without a full page reload. Disable only if plugins misbehave."
msgstr "Iyo byemejwe, igikoresho gitangiza htmx kirashyirwamo kugira ngo impapuro zibihisemo zishobore kuvugurura ibisubizo by'imiyunguruzo yazo bitabaye ngombwa ko urupapuro rwose rwongera gufungurwa. Bihagarike gusa niba imigereka ikora nabi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "On (default)"
msgstr "Biriho (mburabuzi)"

#: include/global_settings.php support.php
msgid "Off"
msgstr "Ntibiriho"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remote Agent"
msgstr "Umukozi wa Kure"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When using multiple Data Collectors, there are the Settings for Communicating between Data Collectors"
msgstr "Iyo ukoresha Abakusanya Amakuru benshi, aya ni Amagenamiterere yo Guhanahana Amakuru hagati y'Abakusanya Amakuru"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "TCP Port"
msgstr "Icyambu cya TCP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The TCP Port used for communicating with the Remote Data Collectors.  The protocol will match the Central Cacti web server (either HTTP or HTTPS).  Leave blank to use the default ports."
msgstr "Icyambu cya TCP gikoreshwa mu guhanahana amakuru n'Abakusanya Amakuru ba Kure. Porotokole izahuza na seriveri ya urubuga ya Cacti yo hagati (yaba HTTP cyangwa HTTPS). Siga ubusa kugira ngo ukoreshe ibyambu mburabuzi."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The amount of time, in seconds, that the Central Cacti web server will wait for a response from the Remote Data Collector to obtain various Device information before abandoning the request.  On Devices that are associated with Data Collectors other than the Central Cacti Data Collector, the Remote Agent must be used to gather Device information."
msgstr "Igihe, mu masegonda, seriveri ya urubuga ya Cacti yo hagati izategereza igisubizo kivuye ku Mukusanya Amakuru wa Kure kugira ngo ibone amakuru atandukanye y'Igikoresho mbere yo kureka isaba. Ku Bikoresho bifitanye isano n'Abakusanya Amakuru batari Umukusanya Amakuru wa Cacti wo hagati, Umukozi wa Kure agomba gukoreshwa mu gukusanya amakuru y'Igikoresho."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Verify Remote Agent TLS Certificates"
msgstr "Genzura Ibyemezo bya TLS by'Umukozi wa Kure"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Require a trusted certificate whose name matches the Remote Data Collector hostname. Disable only while replacing legacy self-signed certificates."
msgstr "Bisaba icyemezo cyizewe gifite izina rihuye n'izina rya seriveri y'Umukusanya Amakuru wa Kure. Bihagarike gusa mu gihe usimbura ibyemezo bya kera bisinywe ku giti cyabyo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "No (Legacy Self-signed Certificate)"
msgstr "Oya (Icyemezo cya Kera Gisinywe ku Giti Cyacyo)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Remote Agent CA File"
msgstr "Idosiye ya CA y'Umukozi wa Kure"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Optional absolute path to a PEM CA bundle used to verify Remote Data Collector certificates. Leave blank to use the PHP/OpenSSL system trust store."
msgstr "Inzira yuzuye itari itegeko igana ku itsinda rya PEM CA rikoreshwa mu kugenzura ibyemezo by'Umukusanya Amakuru wa Kure. Siga ubusa kugira ngo ukoreshe ububiko bw'ibyizewe bya sisitemu ya PHP/OpenSSL."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Logging Level"
msgstr "Urwego rwo Kwandika Ibikorwa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Logging level for Automation activities.  Levels are Low, Medium and High."
msgstr "Urwego rwo Kwandika Ibikorwa ku bikorwa by'Ikoramyikorere. Inzego ni Hasi, Hagati na Hejuru."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Force Serial Automation Scans"
msgstr "Hata Igenzura ry'Ikoramyikorere Rikurikiranye"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When enabled, Cacti Automation will scan one network at a time not in Parallel.  This setting can be useful when your Cacti Web Servers have limited cores for performing Automation checks."
msgstr "Iyo byemejwe, Ikoramyikorere rya Cacti rizagenzura umuyoboro umwe icyarimwe aho kubikorera hamwe icyarimwe. Iri genamiterere rishobora kuba ingirakamaro igihe Seriveri zawe za Urubuga za Cacti zifite ubushobozi bwa poroseseri buke bwo gukora igenzura ry'Ikoramyikorere."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Graph Creation"
msgstr "Emeza Ikorwa Ryikora ry'Imbonerahamwe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Graph.  This is useful when adjusting Device settings so as to avoid creating new Graphs each time you save an object.  Invoking Automation Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Iyo bihagaritswe, Ikoramyikorere rya Cacti ntirizakora ku buryo bwihuse Imbonerahamwe iyo ari yo yose. Ibi ni ingirakamaro igihe uhindura amagenamiterere y'Igikoresho kugira ngo wirinde gukora Imbonerahamwe nshya buri gihe ubitse ikintu. Gukoresha Amategeko y'Ikoramyikorere n'intoki bizakomeza gushoboka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Automatic Tree Item Creation"
msgstr "Emeza Ikorwa Ryikora ry'Ibintu byo mu Giti"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When disabled, Cacti Automation will not actively create any Tree Item.  This is useful when adjusting Device or Graph settings so as to avoid creating new Tree Entries each time you save an object.  Invoking Rules manually will still be possible."
msgstr "Iyo bihagaritswe, Ikoramyikorere rya Cacti ntirizakora ku buryo bwihuse Ikintu icyo ari cyo cyose cyo mu Giti. Ibi ni ingirakamaro igihe uhindura amagenamiterere y'Igikoresho cyangwa y'Imbonerahamwe kugira ngo wirinde gukora Ibyinjizwa mu Giti bishya buri gihe ubitse ikintu. Gukoresha Amategeko n'intoki bizakomeza gushoboka."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification To Email"
msgstr "Imeri Yohererezwa Imenyekanisha ry'Ikoramyikorere"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Address to send Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the Primary Cacti Admins Email account."
msgstr "Aderesi ya Imeri yo koherezaho Imeri z'Imenyekanisha ry'Ikoramyikorere niba itashyizweho ku rwego rw'Umuyoboro w'Ikoramyikorere. Niba iki gice, cyangwa agaciro k'Umuyoboro w'Ikoramyikorere bisizweho ubusa, Cacti izakoresha konti ya Imeri y'Abayobozi b'Ibanze ba Cacti."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification From Name"
msgstr "Izina ry'Uwohereza Imenyekanisha ry'Ikoramyikorere"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Name to use for Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the system default From Name."
msgstr "Izina rya Imeri rikoreshwa ku Imeri z'Imenyekanisha ry'Ikoramyikorere niba ritashyizweho ku rwego rw'Umuyoboro w'Ikoramyikorere. Niba iki gice, cyangwa agaciro k'Umuyoboro w'Ikoramyikorere bisizweho ubusa, Cacti izakoresha Izina ry'Uwohereza mburabuzi rya sisitemu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Automation Notification From Email"
msgstr "Imeri y'Uwohereza Imenyekanisha ry'Ikoramyikorere"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The Email Address to use for Automation Notification Emails to if not specified at the Automation Network level.  If either this field, or the Automation Network value are left blank, Cacti will use the system default From Email Address."
msgstr "Aderesi ya imeyili ikoreshwa kuri imeyili z'imenyesha ry'ikora ryikora niba itagenwe ku rwego rw'urusobemiyoboro rw'ikora ryikora. Niba uyu mwanya cyangwa agaciro k'urusobemiyoboro rw'ikora ryikora bisizwe ubusa, Cacti izakoresha aderesi ya imeyili yohereza isanzwe ya sisitemu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Template Defaults"
msgstr "Igenamiterere ry'ibanze ry'inyandikorugero y'igishushanyo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Graph Template Test Data Source"
msgstr "Isuzuma ry'isoko y'amakuru ry'inyandikorugero y'igishushanyo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Check this checkbox if you wish to test the Data Sources prior to their creation for new and newly imported Graph Templates.  With Test Data Sources enabled, if the Data Source does not return valid data, the Graph will not be created.  This setting is important if you wish to have a more generic Device Template that can include more Graph Templates that can be selectively applied depending on the characteristics of the Device itself.  Note: If you have a long running script as a Data Source, the time to create Graphs will be increased."
msgstr "Hitamo aka gasanduku niba wifuza gusuzuma amasoko y'amakuru mbere yo kuyarema ku nyandikorugero z'ibishushanyo nshya n'izimaze gutumizwa. Iyo isuzuma ry'amasoko y'amakuru rikoreshwa, niba isoko y'amakuru idatanze amakuru yemewe, igishushanyo ntikizaremwa. Iri genamiterere ni ingenzi niba wifuza kugira inyandikorugero y'igikoresho rusange ishobora kuba ikubiyemo inyandikorugero z'ibishushanyo nyinshi zishobora gukoreshwa ku buryo buhitamo bitewe n'imiterere y'igikoresho ubwacyo. Icyitonderwa: Niba ufite porogaramu nto ikora igihe kirekire nk'isoko y'amakuru, igihe cyo kurema ibishushanyo kiziyongera."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default Image Format to be used for all new Graph Templates."
msgstr "Imiterere y'ishusho isanzwe igomba gukoreshwa ku nyandikorugero z'ibishushanyo nshya zose."

#: include/global_settings.php
