msgid "must be a non-negative integer."
msgstr "igomba kuba umubare wuzuye utari munsi ya zeru."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Behavior"
msgstr "Imyitwarire ya SNMP"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "SNMP Agent Support Enabled"
msgstr "Ubufasha bwa SNMP Agent bwemejwe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If this option is checked, Cacti will populate SNMP Agent tables with Cacti device and system information.  It does not enable the SNMP Agent itself."
msgstr "Niba aya mahitamo atoranyijwe, Cacti izuzuza imbonerahamwe za SNMP Agent amakuru y'igikoresho na sisitemu ya Cacti. Ntiyemeza SNMP Agent ubwayo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable MD5 and DES for SNMPv3"
msgstr "Emeza MD5 na DES kuri SNMPv3"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The MD5 authentication and DES privacy algorithms are legacy, weak, and unavailable on hardened (FIPS) PHP and Net-SNMP builds.  When disabled, MD5 and DES are removed from the SNMPv3 Authentication and Privacy Protocol dropdowns shown when editing a Device and in the Automation SNMP Options, leaving only the stronger SHA and AES algorithms."
msgstr "Uburyo bwo kwemeza bwa MD5 n'ubw'ibanga bwa DES ni ubwa kera, buroroshye kandi ntibuboneka kuri PHP na Net-SNMP byakomejwe (FIPS). Iyo buhagaritswe, MD5 na DES bivanwa ku rutonde ruhitamo rwa porotokole yo kwemeza n'iy'ibanga za SNMPv3 bigaragara iyo uhindura igikoresho no mu mahitamo ya SNMP y'ikora ryikora, hagasigara gusa uburyo bukomeye bwa SHA na AES."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Credential Cache"
msgstr "Emeza Ububiko bw'agateganyo bw'ibyangombwa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Pre-harden and cache SNMPv3 credential arguments once per credential change so each poller process reuses them instead of rebuilding them on every request.  This yields a marginal savings when collecting with SNMPv3 credentials through the Net-SNMP binaries.  The php-snmp extension handles most SNMPv3 gets in-process and bypasses this cache, but the Net-SNMP binaries (and therefore this cache) are still used for SNMP walks, hex output, requests that set a context or engine id, and protocol combinations that the running PHP version does not support.  Enable this if you collect any of those workloads with SNMPv3 credentials."
msgstr "Tegura mbere kandi ubike mu bubiko bw'agateganyo ingingo z'ibyangombwa bya SNMPv3 rimwe kuri buri mpinduka y'ibyangombwa kugira ngo buri gikorwa cy'umukusanyamakuru cyongere kubikoresha aho kongera kubyubaka kuri buri busabe. Ibi bitanga inyungu nto iyo ukusanya ukoresheje ibyangombwa bya SNMPv3 binyuze muri porogaramu za Net-SNMP. Umugereka wa php-snmp utunganya igice kinini cyo kubona SNMPv3 mu gikorwa imbere kandi urenga ubu bubiko bw'agateganyo, ariko porogaramu za Net-SNMP (bityo n'ubu bubiko bw'agateganyo) ziracyakoreshwa ku kugenzura urutonde rwa SNMP (walks), ibisohoka muri hex, ubusabe bushiraho context cyangwa engine id, n'ihuza rya porotokole verisiyo ya PHP iri gukora idashyigikira. Emeza ibi niba ukusanya imwe muri iyo mirimo ukoresheje ibyangombwa bya SNMPv3."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Max OID Limit"
msgstr "Umubare ntarengwa wa OID"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The default maximum number of SNMP Get OIDs to issue per snmpget request.  For Devices, this setting is controlled at the Device level.  You should only use this setting when using Cacti's SNMP API natively in your scripts or plugins."
msgstr "Umubare ntarengwa usanzwe wa SNMP Get OIDs ugomba gutangwa kuri buri busabe bwa snmpget. Ku bikoresho, iri genamiterere rigengwa ku rwego rw'igikoresho. Ugomba gukoresha iri genamiterere gusa igihe ukoresha SNMP API ya Cacti mu buryo busanzwe mu nyandikobikorwa cyangwa imigereka yawe."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Bulkwalk Fetch Size"
msgstr "Ingano yo kuzana muri Bulkwalk"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How many OID's should be returned per snmpbulkwalk request?  For Devices with large SNMP trees, increasing this size will increase re-index performance over a WAN."
msgstr "Ni OID zingahe zigomba kugarurwa kuri buri busabe bwa snmpbulkwalk?  Ku bikoresho bifite ibiti bya SNMP binini, kongera iyi ngano bizongera umuvuduko wo kongera gutondeka kuri WAN."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Disable increasing OID Check"
msgstr "Hagarika isuzuma ryo kwiyongera kwa OID"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Controls disabling check for increasing OID while walking OID tree."
msgstr "Bigenzura guhagarika isuzuma rya OID ziyongera mu gihe ushakisha mu giti cya OID."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Availability/Reachability"
msgstr "Kuboneka/Kugerwaho"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Availability/Reachability for all new Devices.  The method Cacti will use to determine if a Device is available for polling.  <br><i>NOTE: It is recommended that, at a minimum, SNMP always be selected.</i>"
msgstr "Kuboneka/Kugerwaho mbanziriza ku bikoresho bishya byose.  Uburyo Cacti izakoresha mu kumenya niba igikoresho kiboneka ngo gikusanyirizwe amakuru.  <br><i>ICYITONDERWA: Birasabwa ko, nibura, SNMP ihora ihiswemo.</i>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Downed Device SNMP Recovery Options Retry Frequency"
msgstr "Inshuro zo kongera kugerageza amahitamo yo kuzahura SNMP ku gikoresho cyahagaze"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When a Device is Down, and has an SNMP Recovery Options Set established, how often do you wish to try to retry the Device using the SNMP Options Set specified?"
msgstr "Iyo igikoresho cyahagaze, kandi kikaba gifite itsinda ry'amahitamo yo kuzahura SNMP ryashyizweho, wifuza kugerageza kongera kugenzura igikoresho inshuro zingahe ukoresheje itsinda ry'amahitamo rya SNMP ryatanzwe?"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Ping Type"
msgstr "Ubwoko bwa Ping"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Ping type for all new Devices.</i>"
msgstr "Ubwoko bwa Ping mbanziriza ku bikoresho bishya byose.</i>"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Ping Port for all new Devices.  With TCP, Cacti will attempt to Syn the port.  With UDP, Cacti requires either a successful connection, or a 'port not reachable' error to determine if the Device is up or not."
msgstr "Umuyoboro wa Ping mbanziriza ku bikoresho bishya byose.  Kuri TCP, Cacti izagerageza gukora Syn kuri uwo muyoboro.  Kuri UDP, Cacti isaba ko habaho ukwihuza kwagenze neza, cyangwa ikosa rya 'port not reachable' kugira ngo imenye niba igikoresho gikora cyangwa kitakora."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Default Ping Timeout value in milli-seconds for all new Devices.  The timeout values to use for Device SNMP, ICMP, UDP and TCP pinging.  ICMP Pings will be rounded up to the nearest second.  TCP and UDP connection timeouts on Windows are controlled by the operating system, and are therefore not recommended on Windows."
msgstr "Agaciro mbanziriza k'igihe ntarengwa cya Ping muri milisegonda ku bikoresho bishya byose.  Ibihe ntarengwa bikoreshwa kuri Ping ya SNMP, ICMP, UDP na TCP y'igikoresho.  Ping za ICMP zizahurizwa ku isegonda ryegereye hejuru.  Ibihe ntarengwa byo kwihuza bya TCP na UDP kuri Windows bigengwa na sisitemu y'imikorere, bityo rero ntibisabwa kuri Windows."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of times Cacti will attempt to ping a Device before marking it as down."
msgstr "Umubare w'inshuro Cacti izagerageza gukora ping ku gikoresho mbere yo kukimenyekanisha nk'icyahagaze."

