msgid "Check this option if you wish users to locally enable Two Factor Authentication for their accounts.  Note that most Enterprise level MFA does not require intervention by the Cacti Administrator."
msgstr "Hitamo aka kazu niba wifuza ko abakoresha bifungurira uburyo bwo kwemeza umwirondoro mu byiciro bibiri (2FA) kuri konti zabo. Icyitonderwa: uburyo bwinshi bwa MFA ku rwego rw'ibigo binini ntibusaba uruhare rw'Umuyobozi wa Cacti."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Token Lifetime"
msgstr "Igihe tokeni imara"

