msgid "Force Complexity Upon Old Passwords"
msgstr "Shyiraho itegeko ry'ubukomezi ku majambo y'ibanga ashaje"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This will require all old passwords to also meet the new complexity requirements upon login.  If not met, it will force a password change."
msgstr "Ibi bizasaba ko amajambo y'ibanga yose ashaje na yo yuzuza ibisabwa bishya by'ubukomezi mu gihe cyo kwinjira. Iyo bitujujwe, bizahatira umukoresha guhindura ijambo ry'ibanga."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Expire Inactive Accounts"
msgstr "Kurangira kwa konti zidakoreshwa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is maximum number of days before inactive accounts are disabled.  The Admin account is excluded from this policy."
msgstr "Uyu ni umubare ntarengwa w'iminsi mbere y'uko konti zidakoreshwa zihagarikwa. Konti ya Admin ntiyarebwa n'iri tegeko."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Expire Password"
msgstr "Kurangira kw'ijambo ry'ibanga"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This is maximum number of days before a password is set to expire."
msgstr "Uyu ni umubare ntarengwa w'iminsi mbere y'uko ijambo ry'ibanga rirangira."

