#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Should Boost enable on demand RRD updating in Cacti?  If you disable, this change will not take affect until after the next polling cycle.  When you have Remote Data Collectors, this settings is required to be on."
msgstr "Ese Boost igomba kwemerera ivugururwa rya RRD igihe bisabwe muri Cacti? Niba ubifunze, iri hinduka ntirizatangira gukora kugeza nyuma y'icyiciro gikurikira cyo gukusanya amakuru (polling). Iyo ufite abakusanyamakuru ba kure (Remote Data Collectors), iri genamiterere rigomba kuba rifunguye."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "System Level RRD Updater"
msgstr "Ivugurura rya RRD ku rwego rwa sisitemu"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Before RRD On-demand Update Can be Cleared, a poller run must always pass"
msgstr "Mbere y'uko ivugururwa rya RRD igihe bisabwe risibwa, igikorwa cya poller kigomba buri gihe kubanza gutambuka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "How Often Should Boost Update All RRDs"
msgstr "Ni kangahe Boost igomba kuvugurura za RRD zose"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When you enable boost, your RRD files are only updated when they are requested by a user, or when this time period elapses."
msgstr "Iyo ufunguye Boost, dosiye zawe za RRD zivugururwa gusa igihe zisabwe n'umukoresha, cyangwa igihe iki gihe kirangiye."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of Boost Processes"
msgstr "Umubare w'ibikorwa bya Boost"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The number of concurrent boost processes to use to use to process all of the RRDs in the boost table."
msgstr "Umubare w'ibikorwa bya Boost bikora icyarimwe bigomba gukoreshwa mu gutunganya za RRD zose ziri mu mbonerahamwe ya Boost."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Records"
msgstr "Umubare ntarengwa w'amakuru yanditswe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost output table exceeds this size, in records, an update will take place."
msgstr "Niba imbonerahamwe y'ibisohoka bya Boost irengeje iyi ngano, mu mubare w'amakuru yanditswe, ivugurura rizahita riba."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Data Source Items Per Pass"
msgstr "Umubare ntarengwa w'ibigize isoko y'amakuru ku nshuro imwe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "To optimize performance, the boost RRD updater needs to know how many Data Source Items should be retrieved in one pass.  Please be careful not to set too high as graphing performance during major updates can be compromised.  If you encounter graphing or polling slowness during updates, lower this number.  The default value is 50000."
msgstr "Kugira ngo imikorere irusheho kuba myiza, uvugurura RRD wa Boost akeneye kumenya umubare w'ibigize isoko y'amakuru bigomba kuvanwaho ku nshuro imwe. Nyamuneka witondere kudashyiramo umubare munini cyane kuko imikorere yo gushushanya mu gihe cy'amavugurura manini ishobora kwangirika. Niba uhuye n'ubugenda gahoro mu gushushanya cyangwa mu gukusanya amakuru igihe cy'ivugurura, gabanya uyu mubare. Agaciro k'ibanze ni 50000."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum Argument Length"
msgstr "Uburebure ntarengwa bw'ingingo (Argument)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "When boost sends update commands to RRDtool, it must not exceed the operating systems Maximum Argument Length.  This varies by operating system and kernel level.  For example: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ unlimited"
msgstr "Igihe Boost yohereza amabwiriza yo kuvugurura kuri RRDtool, ntigomba kurenga uburebure ntarengwa bw'ingingo (Maximum Argument Length) bwa sisitemu y'imikorere. Ibi bitandukana bitewe na sisitemu y'imikorere n'urwego rwa kernel. Urugero: Windows 2000 <= 2048, FreeBSD <= 65535, Linux 2.6.22-- <= 131072, Linux 2.6.23++ nta mupaka"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Memory Limit for Boost and Poller"
msgstr "Umupaka w'ububiko bw'agateganyo (Memory) kuri Boost na Poller"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "The maximum amount of memory for the Cacti Poller and Boosts Poller"
msgstr "Ingano ntarengwa y'ububiko bw'agateganyo (memory) kuri Poller ya Cacti na Poller ya Boost"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Maximum RRD Update Script Run Time"
msgstr "Igihe ntarengwa cy'imikorere ya porogaramu ivugurura RRD"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If the boost poller exceeds this runtime, a warning will be placed in the cacti log,"
msgstr "Niba poller ya Boost irengeje iki gihe cy'imikorere, iburira rizashyirwa muri dosiye y'ibyabaye ya Cacti,"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Enable Boost Debugging"
msgstr "Emera gukemura ibibazo kwa Boost (Debugging)"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "If set, Boost will log debug information directly to the Boost log file.  Please note, enabling can cause a high I/O rate on the local file system."
msgstr "Niba bishyizweho, Boost izandika amakuru yo gukemura ibibazo ako kanya muri dosiye y'ibyabaye ya Boost. Nyamuneka zirikana ko kubifungura bishobora gutera umuvuduko mwinshi wa I/O kuri sisitemu ya dosiye y'imbere."

