#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Collection Method"
msgstr "Uburyo bwo gukusanya amakuru"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Data Source Statistics can use a legacy method where it will determine peak and average values, or an advanced mode which will calculated several additional statistical values in addition to peak and average.  Using All Statistical Metrics can place additional CPU and IO load on the system."
msgstr "Imibare y'amasoko y'amakuru ishobora gukoresha uburyo bwa kera aho igena agaciro ko hejuru (peak) n'impuzandengo (average), cyangwa uburyo buteye imbere bubara izindi ndangagaciro nyinshi z'imibare hiyongereyeho agaciro ko hejuru n'impuzandengo. Gukoresha Ibipimo Byose by'Imibare bishobora kongera umutwaro wa CPU na IO kuri sisitemu."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Peak/Average Only"
msgstr "Agaciro ko hejuru/Impuzandengo gusa"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "All Statistical Metrics"
msgstr "Ibipimo Byose by'Imibare"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Calculate Peaks Stats in Addition to Average Stats"
msgstr "Bara imibare y'udusongero (Peaks) hiyongereyeho imibare y'impuzandengo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This option will double the data collection time.  If will use the MAX consolidation function and calculate statistics from the max values in each of the respective time ranges."
msgstr "Iri hitamo rizakuba kabiri igihe cyo gukusanya amakuru. Rizakoresha umukoro wo guhuza wa MAX kandi ribare imibare uhereye ku gaciro ntarengwa muri buri gihe cyagenwe."

#: include/global_settings.php
