msgid "Spike Kill Settings"
msgstr "Igenamiterere ryo gukuraho imizamukire idasanzwe"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Removal Method"
msgstr "Uburyo bwo gukuraho"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are two removal methods.  The first, Standard Deviation, will remove any sample that is X number of standard deviations away from the average of samples."
msgstr "Hari uburyo bubiri bwo gukuraho. Ubwa mbere, Ikinyuranyo fatizo, buzakuraho igipimo icyo ari cyo cyose kiri kure ho X y'ibinyuranyo fatizo uvuye ku mpuzandengo y'ibipimo."

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Standard Deviation"
msgstr "Ikinyuranyo fatizo"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Replacement Method"
msgstr "Uburyo bwo gusimbuza"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "There are three replacement methods.  The first method replaces the spike with the average of the data source in question.  The second method replaces the spike with a 'NaN'.  The last replaces the spike with the last known good value found."
msgstr "Hari uburyo butatu bwo gusimbuza. Uburyo bwa mbere busimbuza izamuka rikabije impuzandengo y'isoko y'amakuru ivugwa. Uburyo bwa kabiri busimbuza izamuka rikabije agaciro ka 'NaN'. Uburyo bwa nyuma busimbuza izamuka rikabije agaciro keza ka nyuma kazwi kabonetse."

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Average"
msgstr "Impuzandengo"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "NaN's"
msgstr "Uduciro twa NaN"

#: include/global_settings.php lib/html.php
msgid "Last Known Good"
msgstr "Agaciro keza ka nyuma kazwi"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Number of Standard Deviations"
msgstr "Umubare w'ibinyuranyo by'ifatizo"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Any value that is this many standard deviations above the average will be excluded.  A good number will be dependent on the type of data to be operated on.  We recommend a number no lower than 5 Standard Deviations."
msgstr "Agaciro ako ari ko kose karengeje uyu mubare w'ibinyuranyo by'ifatizo hejuru y'impuzandengo kazakurwaho. Umubare mwiza uzaterwa n'ubwoko bw'amakuru azakorwaho. Turasaba umubare utari munsi y'ibinyuranyo by'ifatizo 5."

#: include/global_settings.php
#, php-format
msgid "%d Standard Deviations"
msgstr "Ibinyuranyo by'ifatizo %d"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "Max Kills Per RRA"
msgstr "Umubare ntarengwa wo gusiba kuri buri RRA"

#: include/global_settings.php
msgid "This value represents the maximum number of spikes to remove from a Graph RRA."
msgstr "Aka gaciro kagaragaza umubare ntarengwa w'izamuka rikabije rigomba gukurwa muri RRA y'igishushanyo."

#: include/global_settings.php
