#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Cacti requires several PHP Modules to be installed to work properly. If any of these are not installed, you will be unable to continue the installation until corrected. In addition, for optimal system performance Cacti should be run with certain MySQL system variables set.  Please follow the MySQL recommendations at your discretion.  Always seek the MySQL documentation if you have any questions."
msgstr "Cacti isaba ko hashirwamo moduli nyinshi za PHP kugira ngo ikore neza. Niba hari imwe muri izo itashyizwemo, ntuzashobora gukomeza iyinjiza kugeza bikosowe. Byongeye kandi, kugira ngo sisitemu ikore neza cyane, Cacti igomba gukoreshwa hari ibipimo bimwe bya sisitemu ya MySQL byagenwe. Nyamuneka kurikiza inama za MySQL uko ubyihitiyemo. Buri gihe jya ureba mu nyandiko za MySQL niba ufite ibibazo."

