#: lib/installer.php
msgid "In the event of issues, It is highly recommended that you clear your browser cache, closing then reopening your browser (not just the tab Cacti is on) and retrying, before raising an issue with The Cacti Group"
msgstr "Mu gihe habaye ibibazo, birasabwa cyane ko usiba ububiko bw'agateganyo bwa mushakisha yawe, ugafunga hanyuma ukongera ugafungura mushakisha yawe (atari akadirishya Cacti irimo gusa) maze ukongera ukagerageza, mbere yo kugeza ikibazo kuri The Cacti Group"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "On rare occasions, we have had reports from users who experience some minor issues due to changes in the code.  These issues are caused by the browser retaining pre-upgrade code and whilst we have taken steps to minimise the chances of this, it may still occur.  If you need instructions on how to clear your browser cache, <a href='https://www.refreshyourcache.com' target='_blank'>https://www.refreshyourcache.com/</a> is a good starting point."
msgstr "Mu bihe bidasanzwe, twagiye twakira raporo z'abakoresha bahura n'ibibazo bito bitewe n'impinduka muri kode. Ibi bibazo biterwa na mushakisha igumana kode ya mbere yo kuvugurura kandi nubwo twafashe ingamba zo kugabanya amahirwe yo kubaho kwabyo, birashoboka ko byaba. Niba ukeneye amabwiriza y'uko wasiba ububiko bw'agateganyo bwa mushakisha yawe, <a href='https://www.refreshyourcache.com' target='_blank'>https://www.refreshyourcache.com/</a> ni intangiriro nziza."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If after clearing your cache and restarting your browser, you still experience issues, please raise the issue with us and we will try to identify the cause of it."
msgstr "Niba nyuma yo gusiba ububiko bw'agateganyo no kongera gufungura mushakisha yawe, ugikomeza guhura n'ibibazo, nyamuneka tugeze ikibazo kuri twe kandi tuzagerageza kumenya icyabiteye."

