msgid "The Installer automatically assigns a $poller_id and adds it to the config.php file."
msgstr "Porogaramu y'iyinjiza ihita itanga $poller_id kandi ikayongera mu idosiye ya config.php."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Once the variables are all set in the config.php file, you must also grant the $rdatabase_username access to the main Cacti database server.  Follow the same procedure you would with any other Cacti install.  You may then press the 'Test Connection' button.  If the test is successful you will be able to proceed and complete the install."
msgstr "Iyo impinduragaciro zose zimaze gushyirwa mu idosiye ya config.php, ugomba kandi guha $rdatabase_username uburenganzira bwo kugera kuri seriveri nkuru y'ububiko bw'amakuru ya Cacti. Kurikiza uburyo bumwe n'ubwo wakoresha mu kindi gikorwa cyo gushyiramo Cacti. Ushobora rero gukanda buto ya 'Gerageza Ihuza'. Niba igerageza rigenze neza, uzashobora gukomeza no kurangiza igikorwa cyo gushyiramo."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Additional Steps After Installation"
msgstr "Intambwe z'inyongera nyuma yo gushyiramo"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "It is essential that the Central Cacti server can communicate via MySQL to each remote Cacti database server.  Once the install is complete, you must edit the Remote Data Collector and ensure the settings are correct.  You can verify using the 'Test Connection' when editing the Remote Data Collector."
msgstr "Ni ngombwa ko seriveri nkuru ya Cacti ishobora kuvugana binyuze muri MySQL na buri seriveri y'ububiko bw'amakuru ya Cacti ya kure. Iyo igikorwa cyo gushyiramo kirangiye, ugomba guhindura Ikusanyamakuru rya kure kandi ukagenzura ko igenamiterere ari ryo. Ushobora kubigenzura ukoresheje 'Gerageza Ihuza' igihe uhindura Ikusanyamakuru rya kure."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Critical Binary Locations and Versions"
