msgstr "Inzira imwe cyangwa nyinshi zigaragara ko zitari zo, ntibishoboka gukomeza"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Directory Permission Checks"
msgstr "Igenzura ry'uburenganzira bw'ububiko"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please ensure the directory permissions below are correct before proceeding.  During the install, these directories need to be owned by the Web Server user.  These permission changes are required to allow the Installer to install Device Template packages which include XML and script files that will be placed in these directories.  If you choose not to install the packages, there is an 'install_package.php' cli script that can be used from the command line after the install is complete."
msgstr "Nyamuneka reba neza ko uburenganzira bw'ububiko buri hasi ari bwo mbere yo gukomeza. Mu gihe cyo gushyiramo porogaramu, ubu bubiko bugomba kuba ari ubw'umukoresha wa Seriveri y'urubuga. Izi mpinduka z'uburenganzira zirakenewe kugira ngo porogaramu ishyiramo ishobore gushyiramo paki z'inyandikorugero z'ibikoresho zirimo amadosiye ya XML na script bizashyirwa muri ubu bubiko. Niba uhisemo kutashyiramo izo paki, hari script ya cli 'install_package.php' ishobora gukoreshwa ku murongo w'amabwiriza nyuma y'uko igikorwa cyo gushyiramo kirangiye."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "After the install is complete, you can make some of these directories read only to increase security."
msgstr "Nyuma y'uko igikorwa cyo gushyiramo kirangiye, ushobora guhindura bumwe muri ubu bubiko bukaba ubwo gusoma gusa kugira ngo wongere umutekano."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "These directories will be required to stay read writable after the install so that the Cacti remote synchronization process can update them as the Main Cacti Web Site changes"
msgstr "Ubu bubiko buzakomeza gusabwa kuba ubwo gusoma no kwandikwamo nyuma yo gushyiramo porogaramu kugira ngo igikorwa cyo guhuza cya kure cya Cacti gishobore kubuvugurura uko Urubuga rukuru rwa Cacti ruhinduka"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If you are installing packages, once the packages are installed, you should change the scripts directory back to read only as this presents some exposure to the web site."
msgstr "Niba uri gushyiramo paki, iyo zimaze gushyirwamo, ugomba gusubiza ububiko bwa scripts ku gusoma gusa kuko ibi bishobora gushyira urubuga mu kaga."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "For remote pollers, it is critical that the paths that you will be updating frequently, including the plugins, scripts, and resources paths have read/write access as the data collector will have to update these paths from the main web server content."
msgstr "Ku ma poller ya kure, ni ngombwa cyane ko inzira uzajya uvugurura kenshi, harimo inzira za plugins, scripts, na resources ziba zifite uburenganzira bwo gusoma/kwandika kuko ikusanyamakuru rizajya rigomba kuvugurura izo nzira rivanye mu birimo biri kuri seriveri nkuru y'urubuga."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Required Writable at Install Time Only"
msgstr "Bisabwa Kwandikwamo mu Gihe cyo Gushyiramo Gusa"

#: lib/installer.php package_import.php
msgid "Not Writable"
msgstr "Ntibwandikwamo"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Required Writable after Install Complete"
msgstr "Bisabwa Kwandikwamo Nyuma yo Kurangiza Gushyiramo"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Potential permission issues"
msgstr "Ibibazo by'uburenganzira bishoboka"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please make sure that your webserver has read/write access to the cacti folders that show errors below."
msgstr "Nyamuneka reba neza ko seriveri yawe y'urubuga ifite uburenganzira bwo gusoma/kwandika mu bubiko bwa cacti bugaragaza amakosa hasi aha."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If SELinux is enabled on your server, you can either permanently disable this, or temporarily disable it and then add the appropriate permissions using the SELinux command-line tools."
msgstr "Niba SELinux ikora kuri seriveri yawe, ushobora kuyihagarika burundu, cyangwa ukayihagarika by'agateganyo hanyuma ukongeraho uburenganzira bukwiye ukoresheje ibikoresho by'umurongo w'amabwiriza bya SELinux."

#: lib/installer.php
#, php-format
msgid "The user '%s' should have MODIFY permission to enable read/write."
msgstr "Umukoresha '%s' agomba kuba afite uburenganzira bwa MODIFY kugira ngo ashobore gusoma/kwandika."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "An example of how to set folder permissions is shown here, though you may need to adjust this depending on your operating system, user accounts and desired permissions."
msgstr "Urugero rw'uko washyiraho uburenganzira bw'ububiko rwerekanwe hano, nubwo bishobora kuba ngombwa ko ubihindura bitewe na sisitemu ikoreshwa, konti z'abakoresha n'uburenganzira wifuza."

