msgid "Once installation has completed the CSRF path, should be set to read-only."
msgstr "Iyo igikorwa cyo gushyiramo kirangiye, inzira ya CSRF igomba gushyirwa ku gusoma gusa."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "All folders are writable"
msgstr "Ububiko bwose burandikwamo"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Linux kernel security modules"
msgstr "Ibice by'umutekano bya kernel ya Linux"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Cacti needs to establish network connections, execute binaries and write files to work. Linux security features such as <b>SELinux</b>, <b>AppArmor</b> or <b>ModSecurity</b> may cause Cacti to become inoperable in some configurations. If problems occur, check the settings of these security tools.<br/><br/>"
msgstr "Cacti ikenera gukora ihuza ry'umuyoboro, gukoresha porogaramu nshingwabikorwa no kwandika amadosiye kugira ngo ikore. Ibikoresho by'umutekano bya Linux nka <b>SELinux</b>, <b>AppArmor</b> cyangwa <b>ModSecurity</b> bishobora gutuma Cacti idakora mu miterere imwe n'imwe. Niba habayeho ibibazo, genzura igenamiterere ry'ibi bikoresho by'umutekano.<br/><br/>"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Input Validation Whitelist Protection"
msgstr "Uburinzi bw'Urutonde rwemewe rwo Kugenzura Ibyinjizwa"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Cacti Data Input methods that call a script can be exploited in ways that a non-administrator can perform damage to either files owned by the poller account, and in cases where someone runs the Cacti poller as root, can compromise the operating system allowing attackers to exploit your infrastructure."
msgstr "Uburyo bwo Kwinjiza Amakuru bwa Cacti buhamagara script bushobora gukoreshwa nabi mu buryo butuma utari umuyobozi ashobora kwangiza amadosiye ya konti ya poller, kandi mu gihe umuntu akoresha poller ya Cacti nka root, bishobora guhungabanya sisitemu ikoreshwa bigaha abagizi ba nabi uburyo bwo gufata ibikorwaremezo byawe."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Therefore, several versions ago, Cacti was enhanced to provide Whitelist capabilities on the these types of Data Input Methods.  Though this does secure Cacti more thoroughly, it does increase the amount of work required by the Cacti administrator to import and manage Templates and Packages."
msgstr "Ku bw'ibyo, guhera kuri verisiyo nyinshi zishize, Cacti yavuguruwe kugira ngo itange ubushobozi bw'Urutonde rwemewe kuri ubu bwoko bw'Uburyo bwo Kwinjiza Amakuru. Nubwo ibi birinda Cacti mu buryo bwimbitse kurushaho, byongera akazi gasabwa umuyobozi wa Cacti mu kuzana no gucunga Inyandikorugero na Paki."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "The way that the Whitelisting works is that when you first import a Data Input Method, or you re-import a Data Input Method, and the script and or arguments change in any way, the Data Input Method, and all the corresponding Data Sources will be immediately disabled until the administrator validates that the Data Input Method is valid."
msgstr "Uburyo Urutonde rwemewe rukoramo ni uko iyo uzanye bwa mbere Uburyo bwo Kwinjiza Amakuru, cyangwa iyo wongeye kuzana Uburyo bwo Kwinjiza Amakuru, maze script na/cyangwa ibipimo byayo bigahinduka mu buryo ubwo ari bwo bwose, Uburyo bwo Kwinjiza Amakuru, n'Inkomoko z'Amakuru zose zijyanye na bwo bihita bihagarikwa ako kanya kugeza igihe umuyobozi yemeje ko ubwo Buryo bwo Kwinjiza Amakuru bwemewe."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "To make identifying Data Input Methods in this state, we have provided a validation script in Cacti's CLI directory that can be run with the following options:"
msgstr "Kugira ngo byorohe kumenya Uburyo bwo Kwinjiza Amakuru buri muri iki cyiciro, twatanze script yo kugenzura mu bubiko bwa CLI bwa Cacti ishobora gukoreshwa hamwe n'amahitamo akurikira:"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This script option will search for any Data Input Methods that are currently banned and provide details as to why."
msgstr "Iri hitamo rya script rizashakisha Uburyo bwo Kwinjiza Amakuru bwose buhagaritswe ubu kandi ritange ibisobanuro ku mpamvu yabiteye."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This script option un-ban the Data Input Methods that are currently banned."
msgstr "Iri hitamo rya script rikuraho ihagarikwa ry'Uburyo bwo Kwinjiza Amakuru bwose buhagaritswe ubu."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "This script option will re-enable any disabled Data Sources."
msgstr "Iri hitamo rya script rizongera gukoresha Inkomoko z'Amakuru zose zahagaritswe."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "It is strongly suggested that you update your config.php to enable this feature by uncommenting the <b>$input_whitelist</b> variable and then running the three CLI script options above after the web based install has completed.<br/><br/>"
msgstr "Birasabwa cyane ko uvugurura dosiye yawe ya config.php kugira ngo wemeze iki gikorwa ukura ikimenyetso cy'igisobanuro ku mpinduragaciro ya <b>$input_whitelist</b> maze ugakoresha amahitamo atatu ya script ya CLI ari hejuru nyuma y'uko iyinjizaporogaramu rishingiye ku rubuga rirangiye.<br/><br/>"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Check the Checkbox below to acknowledge that you have read and understand this security concern"
msgstr "Hitamo agasanduku kari hasi kugira ngo wemeze ko wasomye kandi wumvise iki kibazo kijyanye n'umutekano"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "I have read this statement"
msgstr "Nasomye iri tangazo"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Admin email address"
msgstr "Aderesi imeyili y'umuyobozi"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "In case of problems cacti can send emails to the administrator. The address filled in here will be assigned to the admin account and \"Notify Primary Admin of Issue\" will be enabled. You can change this setting and the email address later. Do not forget to set up the email settings after installation."
msgstr "Mu gihe habayeho ibibazo, Cacti ishobora kohereza ubutumwa bwa imeyili ku muyobozi. Aderesi yuzujwe hano izahabwa konti y'umuyobozi kandi \"Menyesha Umuyobozi Mukuru Ikibazo\" bizahita byemezwa. Ushobora guhindura iri genamiterere na aderesi imeyili nyuma. Ntiwibagirwe gutunganya igenamiterere rya imeyili nyuma yo gushyiramo porogaramu."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Default Profile"
msgstr "Umwirondoro w'Ibanze"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please select the default Data Source Profile to be used for polling sources. This is the maximum amount of time between scanning devices for information so the lower the polling interval, the more work is placed on the Cacti Server host. Long retention profiles store more data, so they take up more disk capacity. Their advantage is that older data is not as consolidated and is therefore more accurate than using shorter retention."
msgstr "Nyamuneka hitamo Umwirondoro w'Ibanze w'Inkomoko y'Amakuru uzajya ukoreshwa mu gukusanya amakuru mu nkomoko. Iki ni cyo gihe ntarengwa hagati yo kugenzura ibikoresho hashakishwa amakuru, bityo uko igihe cyo gukusanya kiba gito, ni ko akazi kenshi gashyirwa kuri seriveri ya Cacti. Imyirondoro ibika amakuru igihe kirekire ibika amakuru menshi, bityo ikaba ifata umwanya munini ku bubiko bwa disiki. Inyungu yayo ni uko amakuru ashaje ategeranywa cyane bityo akaba ari ay'ukuri kurusha gukoresha ibika igihe gito."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Also, select the intended, or configured Cron interval that you wish to use for Data Collection."
msgstr "Nanone, hitamo intera ya Cron iteganyijwe cyangwa yashyizweho wifuza gukoresha mu Gukusanya Amakuru."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Cron Interval"
msgstr "Intera ya Cron"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Default Automation Network"
msgstr "Umuyoboro w'Ibanze w'Ikwikora"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Cacti can automatically scan the network once installation has completed. This will utilise the network range below to work out the range of IPs that can be scanned.  A predefined set of options are defined for scanning which include using both 'public' and 'private' communities."
msgstr "Cacti ishobora gusikana umuyoboro mu buryo bwikora iyo iyinjizaporogaramu rirangiye. Ibi bizakoresha urwego rw'umuyoboro ruri hasi kugira ngo bibare urwego rwa za IP zishobora gusikanwa. Amahitamo yateguwe mbere yo gusikana arimo gukoresha amatsinda ya 'public' na 'private'."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "If your devices require a different set of options to be used first, you may define them below and they will be utilized before the defaults"
msgstr "Niba ibikoresho byawe bisaba ubundi buryo bw'amahitamo bukoreshwa mbere, ushobora kubushyiraho hasi kandi buzakoreshwa mbere y'amahitamo y'ibanze"

