msgstr "Itunganya ry'Inyandikorugero"

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please select the Device Templates that you wish to update during the Upgrade."
msgstr "Nyamuneka hitamo Inyandikorugero z'Ibikoresho wifuza kuvugurura mu gihe cyo Kuvugurura."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Updating Templates that you have already made modifications to is not advisable.  The Upgrade of the Templates will NOT remove modifications to Graph and Data Templates, and can lead to unexpected behavior.  However, if you have not made changes to any Graph, Data Query, or Data Template, reimporting the Package should not have any affect.  In that case, you would have to 'Sync Graphs' to from the Templates after update."
msgstr "Kuvugurura Inyandikorugero wari waramaze guhindura ntibishyigikiwe. Ivugurura ry'Inyandikorugero NTIRIZAKURAHO impinduka zakozwe ku Nyandikorugero z'Ibishushanyo n'iz'Amakuru, kandi rishobora gutera imikorere itari iteganyijwe. Nyamara, niba utarahinduye na rimwe Igishushanyo, Isesengura ry'Amakuru (Data Query), cyangwa Inyandikorugero y'Amakuru, kongera kwinjiza Paki ntacyo bizangiza. Muri icyo gihe, uzakenera gukora 'Sync Graphs' uvanye mu Nyandikorugero nyuma yo kuvugurura."

#: lib/installer.php
msgid "Please select the Device Templates that you wish to use after the Install.  If your Operating System is Windows, you need to ensure that you select the 'Windows Device' Template.  If your Operating System is Linux/UNIX, make sure you select the 'Local Linux Machine' Device Template."
msgstr "Nyamuneka hitamo Inyandikorugero z'Ibikoresho wifuza gukoresha nyuma y'Iyinjiza. Niba Sisitemu y'Imikorere yawe ari Windows, ugomba kwemeza ko uhitamo Inyandikorugero ya 'Windows Device'. Niba Sisitemu y'Imikorere yawe ari Linux/UNIX, menya neza ko uhitamo Inyandikorugero y'Igikoresho ya 'Local Linux Machine'."

