#: login_providers.php
msgid "A space delimited list of DNS hostnames or IP addresses for valid LDAP servers.  Cacti will attempt to use the LDAP servers from left to right to authenticate a user.<br><br>For One-Time Password (OTP/MFA) logins, do not use a space delimited multi-server list.  On a failed bind Cacti advances to the next server and re-binds with the same credentials, and the already-consumed one-time code will be rejected.  Instead enter a single, resilient DNS name fronted by a DNS load balancer (VIP) so that server failover is handled below Cacti and only one authentication bind is ever performed."
msgstr "Urutonde rutandukanyijwe n'umwanya rw'amazina y'ubuturo ya DNS cyangwa aderesi za IP za seriveri za LDAP zemewe. Cacti izagerageza gukoresha seriveri za LDAP uhereye ibumoso ugana iburyo kugira ngo yemeze umukoresha.<br><br>Ku kwinjira gukoresha Ijambobanga ry'Inshuro Imwe (OTP/MFA), ntukoreshe urutonde rwa seriveri nyinshi rutandukanyijwe n'umwanya. Iyo kwihuza kunaniranye, Cacti ikomereza kuri seriveri ikurikira ikongera ikagerageza kwihuza ikoresheje ibyangombwa bimwe, maze kode y'inshuro imwe yamaze gukoreshwa ikangwa. Ahubwo, andikamo izina rimwe rya DNS rishikamye riyoborwa n'iringaniza-mutwaro rya DNS (VIP) kugira ngo ikomeza-mikorere rya seriveri rikorerwe munsi ya Cacti kandi kwihuza kw'iyemeza gukorwe inshuro imwe gusa."

