msgstr "ou=cacti-admins,dc=example,dc=com"

#: login_providers.php
msgid "Group Member Attribute"
msgstr "Ikirango cy'Umunyamuryango w'Itsinda"

#: login_providers.php
msgid "This refers to the specific attribute within the LDAP directory that holds the usernames of group members. It is crucial to ensure that the attribute value aligns with the configuration specified in the \"Distinguished Name\" or that the actual attribute value is searchable using the settings outlined in the \"Distinguished Name\"."
msgstr "Ibi byerekeza ku kirango cyihariye mu bubiko bwa LDAP kibika amazina y'abakoresha b'abanyamuryango b'itsinda. Ni ingenzi cyane kwemeza ko agaciro k'ikirango gahuje n'igenamiterere ryasobanuwe muri \"Izina Rihariwe (DN)\" cyangwa ko agaciro nyako k'ikirango gashobora gushakishwa hakoreshejwe igenamiterere ryagaragajwe muri \"Izina Rihariwe (DN)\"."

#: login_providers.php
msgid "memberUid"
msgstr "memberUid"

