msgid "The file holding the SSL Certificate Authority to use to connect to the remote database.  This is an optional parameter that can be required by the database provider if they have started SSL using the --ssl-mode=VERIFY_CA option."
msgstr "Dosiye ibitse Ikigo gitanga Icyemezo cya SSL yo kwifashisha mu kwihuza ku bubiko bw'amakuru bwa kure. Iki ni ikiranga kitari itegeko gishobora gusabwa n'utanga ububiko bw'amakuru niba yatangije SSL akoresheje ihitamo rya --ssl-mode=VERIFY_CA."

