msgid "The file path to the directory that contains the trusted SSL Certificate Authority certificates. This is an optional parameter that can used instead of giving the path to an individual Certificate Authority file. This parameter can be required by the database provider if they have started SSL using the --ssl-mode=VERIFY_CA option."
msgstr "Inzira y'ububiko irimo ibyemezo byizewe by'Ikigo gitanga Ibyemezo bya SSL. Iki ni ikiranga kitari itegeko gishobora gukoreshwa aho gutanga inzira ya dosiye imwe y'Ikigo gitanga Ibyemezo. Iki kiranga gishobora gusabwa n'utanga ububiko bw'amakuru niba yatangije SSL akoresheje ihitamo rya --ssl-mode=VERIFY_CA."

#: pollers.php
msgid "Provides a way to disable verification of the server's SSL certificate Common Name against the server's hostname when connecting. This verification is enabled by default."
msgstr "Itanga uburyo bwo guhagarika igenzura ry'Izina Rusange ry'icyemezo cya SSL cya seriveri ugereranyije n'izina ry'umwakirizi wa seriveri igihe uhuza. Iri genzura riba ryemejwe mu buryo mbonera."

